# Root pointer for developers.
# The API runtime reads production/api/.env — copy the API template:
#
#   cd production/api
#   copy .env.example .env
#
# See production/api/.env.example for every API variable (placeholders only).
#
# React (apps/pos-admin-web) optional Vite vars — create apps/pos-admin-web/.env.local
# (never commit):
#
#   VITE_API_PROXY=http://localhost:3011
#   VITE_ALLOW_AUTH_BYPASS=false
#   VITE_EMPLOYEE_IDLE_MS=900000
#
# VITE_ALLOW_AUTH_BYPASS=true is DEV-only; production builds fail if it is set.
